     "type": "string",
     "description": "The rule as written: ConQuer-92 text (section 6.11). A fact-type rule is `LIST a1, ..., an FROM P`, one listed thing per role in role order; a subtype rule is a path whose heads are the population. The compiler lowers it into `body`."
